<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Nestle.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 7.5 million American-style call warrants, on Nestle registered shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one shares.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,500.00 SFR	    PREMIUM	18.37 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.33 SFR		  GEARING	6.28 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.JAN.02		 PAYDATE	30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  1,464.00 SFR</p>
<p>-- Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
